{
  "total_duration": 690.57,
  "lines": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.56,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "如果一台花了十多亿美元的太空望远镜，第一次传回来的照片却很模糊，会不会很尴尬？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "start": 7.91,
      "end": 13.966,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这就是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Hubble telescope"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "一开始遇到的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "trouble"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 14.316,
      "end": 22.787,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它不是没有飞上太空，而是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "main mirror"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "有问题，所以照片很"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "disappointing"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 23.137,
      "end": 29.417,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "更厉害的是，NASA 没有放弃，而是准备把宇航员送上去，在太空里把它修好。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 29.767,
      "end": 36.171,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "hook",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "今天抓住这条线："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "big machine, real fault, brave repair, clear universe"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 36.521,
      "end": 40.441,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看这个昂贵的大项目被送进太空。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 40.791,
      "end": 48.951,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Hubble telescope 由 NASA 在 1990 年 4 月 20 日发射到太空，花费超过十亿美元。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 49.301,
      "end": 57.1,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文开头是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The Hubble telescope was launched into space by NASA on April 20, 1990"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 57.45,
      "end": 62.386,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Was launched"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是被发射，重点放在望远镜身上。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 62.736,
      "end": 66.856,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "后面说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "at a cost of over a billion dollars"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 67.206,
      "end": 73.95,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "At a cost of"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是新闻报道式表达，告诉你这个项目非常昂贵。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 74.3,
      "end": 80.316,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "launched into space, by NASA, over a billion dollars"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 80.666,
      "end": 83.866,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧，兴奋很快变成了失望。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 84.215,
      "end": 92.215,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：从一开始 Hubble 就有 trouble，它传回来的 pictures 很令人失望，因为主镜是 faulty 的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "start": 92.565,
      "end": 96.673,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Right from the start there was trouble with the Hubble"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "start": 97.023,
      "end": 102.639,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Right from the start"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是从一开始，不是后来才慢慢出问题。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "start": 102.989,
      "end": 109.757,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "接着是原因："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The pictures it sent us were very disappointing because its main mirror was faulty"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "start": 110.107,
      "end": 117.778,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "faulty"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是很冷静的工程词，意思是有缺陷、有故障。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "start": 118.128,
      "end": 123.288,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "2"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第二帧记住因果："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "faulty mirror, so disappointing pictures"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "start": 123.638,
      "end": 128.078,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧，看人类怎么在太空里修一台望远镜。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "start": 128.428,
      "end": 134.668,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：NASA 要把 telescope 修好，所以会派四名 astronauts 上去维修。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "start": 135.018,
      "end": 139.414,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "NASA is now going to put the telescope right"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "start": 139.764,
      "end": 144.636,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Put the telescope right"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是把它摆正，而是把问题修好。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "start": 144.985,
      "end": 150.933,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "然后是行动计划："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "it will soon be sending up four astronauts to repair it"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "start": 151.283,
      "end": 155.867,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The shuttle Endeavour"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "会把 astronauts 带到 Hubble 那里。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "start": 156.217,
      "end": 164.873,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课本里的 robot-arm，我们朗读时就理解成"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "robot arm"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "：机械臂会抓住并托住 telescope。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "start": 165.223,
      "end": 172.087,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "关键动作是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "grab the telescope and hold it while the astronauts make the necessary repairs"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "start": 172.437,
      "end": 178.62,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "3"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第三帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Endeavour, robot arm, grab, hold, repair"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "start": 178.97,
      "end": 181.93,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧，看修好以后为什么值得期待。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "start": 182.28,
      "end": 191.8,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：Hubble 在地球 atmosphere 之外，所以能传回非常清晰的 stars 和 distant galaxies 图片。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "start": 192.15,
      "end": 202.734,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意，这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "stars"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是恒星，不是行星；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "distant galaxies"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是遥远的星系。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "start": 203.084,
      "end": 207.072,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the Hubble is above the earth's atmosphere"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "start": 207.421,
      "end": 215.493,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为它在大气层外，所以会传回："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the clearest pictures of the stars and distant galaxies that we have ever seen"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "start": 215.843,
      "end": 224.483,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "它还会告诉我们很多关于 universe 年龄和大小的信息："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "a great deal about the age and size of the universe"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "start": 224.833,
      "end": 231.685,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "最后一句的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "eagle eye"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是比喻，意思是看得特别清楚的 sharp eye。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "start": 232.035,
      "end": 238.283,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "above the atmosphere, clearest pictures, eagle eye"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "start": 238.632,
      "end": 242.972,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，为什么一定要把望远镜放到 atmosphere 外面？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "start": 243.321,
      "end": 250.841,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为地球的大气像一层会晃动的空气，它在我们和遥远星光之间，会让画面不够清楚。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "start": 251.191,
      "end": 256.464,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "above the atmosphere"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就能看得更清楚？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "start": 256.814,
      "end": 262.894,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对，Hubble 原本的优势就在这里：避开大气，拍到更清楚的 space pictures。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "start": 263.244,
      "end": 266.782,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "可是它都在太空里了，为什么还会失败？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "start": 267.132,
      "end": 279.476,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为高科技也可能有一个很小但很关键的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "fault"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。这一课的重点不是“永远不出错”，而是发现问题以后"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "put it right"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "start": 279.826,
      "end": 284.112,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "eagle eye"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是真的鹰眼吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "start": 284.462,
      "end": 292.542,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是。它是一个比喻：像鹰一样 sharp，意思是 Hubble 修好以后有非常清楚的视力。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "start": 292.892,
      "end": 296.944,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以这个故事不是灾难片，而是 repair story。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "start": 297.294,
      "end": 306.254,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。科学和工程厉害的地方，常常就是找出 fault，修好它，然后继续看见更大的 universe。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "start": 306.603,
      "end": 313.923,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "The Hubble telescope was launched into space by NASA on April 20, 1990 at a cost of over a billion dollars."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 314.273,
      "end": 317.609,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
